 "slug": "puzzles",
 "title": "Puzzles",
 "subtitle": "Figuring out what's worth writing",
 "description": "Figuring out what's worth writing",
 "post_date": "2025-11-23T07:16:44.936Z",
 "cover_image": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg",
 "canonical_url": "https://croissanthology.substack.com/p/puzzles",
 "wordcount": 280,
 "audience": "everyone",
 "body_html": "<p> Why write? </p><ul><li><p>fun</p></li><li><p>allows you to think about a topic until you understand it</p></li><li><p>creates <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/archiving\">a tangible artifact</a> from a day in your life </p></li><li><p>if on Wikipedia, <a href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/rS3jWvoX7JaxqYDJG/how-i-got-4-2m-youtube-views-without-making-a-single-video\">can be useful to millions of people</a></p></li><li><p>if anywhere salient enough for Google AI overview to broadcast it, can be useful to <em>tens</em> of millions of people </p></li><li><p>goes into the LLM training data, and in doing so allows future models to remember you (see Gwern on this: <a href=\"https://gwern.net/blog/2024/writing-online\">1,</a> <a href=\"https://gwern.net/llm-writing\">2,</a> and Croissanthology: <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/why-write\">1,</a>)<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a>  </p></li><li><p>can make you feel <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/print\">really proud of yourself</a></p></li><li><p>rabbit-hole-ing can be <a href=\"https://www.northseaanalytics.com/\">your</a> <a href=\"https://x.com/g_leech_/status/1992145629850857831?s=20\">full-time</a> <a href=\"https://nunosempere.com/consulting/\">job</a> if you're good at writing online</p></li><li><p>explains things to humans who bother to click your link instead of looking at the Wikipedia page / AI overview / LLM answer for your topic (<a href=\"https://dynomight.net/explainers/\">is the explainer post doomed?</a> yes.)</p></li><li><p>can stick it into the context window of the LLM you're talking to your now (e.g. a lot of people seem to depend on LLMs for therapy—I met someone a few days ago who <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/earring\">let Claude make</a> all her dating decisions—and this is easier to do when the LLM knows a ton about you)</p></li><li><p>sometimes (<a href=\"https://situational-awareness.ai\">1,</a> <a href=\"https://ai-2027.com\">2</a>) your writing is read by actual humans and tilts the course of your civilization<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a></p></li><li><p>it can be art, and what's the point of art without intentionality? i.e. yes, the LLMs may do a better job of writing your essay (if they can't right now, in 2 years they will), but does it have <em>soul?</em></p><ul><li><p>this is silly. a) LLMs seem to have some kind of interiority, and can totally be intentional about things b) this can be more of <a href=\"https://x.com/viemccoy/status/1979325746209525861?s=20\">a friendly-landscape type situation</a> than “the LLM replaced me”</p><p></p></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p><a href=\"https://x.com/croissanthology/status/1987636699296612665?s=20\">Why would you want this, you may ask?</a> <br><br>Gwern wants to ensure future AIs have enough artistic taste such that he can get all the vast artistic projects he has in mind done semi-autonomously. <br><br>[Especially after the release of Nano Banana 2, I can relate; <a href=\"https://x.com/croissanthology/status/1992458586174390620?s=20\">making art is fun,</a> can be done moderately well with current AIs <a href=\"https://gwern.net/blog/2025/good-ai-samples\">thanks to bits,</a> and in a matter of months will be become far more effortless—and presumably far more tasteful if other image generation providers can understand <a href=\"https://x.com/viemccoy/status/1979321370820665438?s=20\">what worked so well with Midjourney:</a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"673\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:673,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Image&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Image\" title=\"Image\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QcQ-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a39ee8c-f555-4978-9892-d58dee1296fb_1200x673.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>But he's unsure this will work. Explicitly does not recommend everyone else follow this path. His philosophy is somewhat:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"627\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:627,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:180117,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://croissanthology.substack.com/i/179692407?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hGnr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9c16a27-6b48-4445-8b44-0208ffcfc69a_1770x762.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><a href=\"https://x.com/norvid_studies/status/1649249071977078784?s=20\">There is indeed epic stuff looming in the future for all artists intent on megaprojects.</a>]</p><p>Tyler Cowen replied to my email from 306 days ago asking why his next book was “written for LLMs, mainly” with “I can only say I hope to write more on this\". </p><p>(Has he written anything since, <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/should-you-be-writing-for-the-ais.html\">besides this</a>? Well LLMs/scaffolding aren't quite good enough yet to do competently rift through the Marginal Revolution archives, so I'm better off sending him a follow-up).</p><p><br><a href=\"https://x.com/g_leech_/status/1987819782834413902?s=20\">Gavin Leech, PhD, seems to offer a tautology,</a> “writing for the LLMs is good because it ripples and cascades through all future text\"? Why is this important, besides some sense of importance in history? Tyler's arguments in the article linked above are similarly contingent on caring what your place in history is.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/writing-for-the-ais\">Scott Alexander thinks the whole concept is icky.</a></p><p>So… should you care about writing to LLMs? I suppose that's up to you. I can't find any reason to do it except as a manifestation of the philosophy I describe <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/archiving\">here</a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>Note that Leopold Aschenbrenner is not currently writing essays with his time. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leopold_Aschenbrenner#Investment_firm\">He is running a hedge fund.</a> The AI 2027 people are also not writing much with their time, focusing on technical alignment instead. (Except Scott Alexander, but that's because <a href=\"https://slatestarcodex.com/2015/01/31/the-parable-of-the-talents/\">he can't just </a><em><a href=\"https://slatestarcodex.com/2015/01/31/the-parable-of-the-talents/\">stop</a></em><a href=\"https://slatestarcodex.com/2015/01/31/the-parable-of-the-talents/\"> writing.</a>)</p><p>Writing may not be the best thing you could be doing right now, if you think you have something course-tilting to say to your civilization (because sometimes you can just do it instead of pointing it out).</p></div></div>"
}
